    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your grandma\u2019s card game \u2014 unless she was secretly an immortal alchemist with a knack for magical relics and explosive potions.\u00a0In this roguelike deckbuilder, you\u2019ll craft hands that follow Cribbage-inspired rules \u2014 but with a chaotic twist. Score big, stack relics, and outplay a deck that\u2019s very clearly out to get you. Every run is a snappy, snarky duel with fate, packed with weird combos and rule-breaking relics that change the game mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts off as a simple decision around what 2 cards to put in the crib...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422700/extras/90aef2c86f49783e2f70768950af5ffe.avif?t=1748218789\" data-has-big width=800 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly turns into an adrenaline-fueled chain reaction of card modifiers that amp up your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422700/extras/f6fe6e0b8c7d3683049d73872784f8fd.avif?t=1748218789\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined with a set of carefully selected relics and potions that can launch your hand scores into the stratosphere.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422700/extras/cea5c7fbfdfa89706bde191c7366316a.avif?t=1748218789\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to become a master of chaining together all the tools that Cribbish puts at your disposal if you hope to beat the final Elite Challenge!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability\u00a0\u2014 Every hand is a puzzle. Every run, a new strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Run Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ different decks to choose from each with it's own unique challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different difficulties to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 different card enhancements to power up the cards in your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ relics, each with it's own unique ability to boost your game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ potions to provide you with instant help when needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ perks that you can use to bend the rules in your favor or upgrade your relics/potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ brutal and elite challenges to stand in your way as you climb the peg board</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be on the look out for synergies between these items, they will not only boost your game but they have the power to increase your scores EXPONENTIALLY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per run stat tracking will help you analyze your game and make improvements. Lifetime user level stats will not only allow you to track your own progress towards becoming a Cribbish master, but they will unlock special items along the way to give you an even bigger edge.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your grandma\u2019s card game \u2014 unless she was secretly an immortal alchemist with a knack for magical relics and explosive potions.\u00a0In this roguelike deckbuilder, you\u2019ll craft hands that follow Cribbage-inspired rules \u2014 but with a chaotic twist. Score big, stack relics, and outplay a deck that\u2019s very clearly out to get you. Every run is a snappy, snarky duel with fate, packed with weird combos and rule-breaking relics that change the game mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts off as a simple decision around what 2 cards to put in the crib...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422700/extras/90aef2c86f49783e2f70768950af5ffe.avif?t=1748218789\" data-has-big width=800 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly turns into an adrenaline-fueled chain reaction of card modifiers that amp up your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422700/extras/f6fe6e0b8c7d3683049d73872784f8fd.avif?t=1748218789\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined with a set of carefully selected relics and potions that can launch your hand scores into the stratosphere.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422700/extras/cea5c7fbfdfa89706bde191c7366316a.avif?t=1748218789\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to become a master of chaining together all the tools that Cribbish puts at your disposal if you hope to beat the final Elite Challenge!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability\u00a0\u2014 Every hand is a puzzle. Every run, a new strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Run Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ different decks to choose from each with it's own unique challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different difficulties to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 different card enhancements to power up the cards in your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ relics, each with it's own unique ability to boost your game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ potions to provide you with instant help when needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ perks that you can use to bend the rules in your favor or upgrade your relics/potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ brutal and elite challenges to stand in your way as you climb the peg board</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be on the look out for synergies between these items, they will not only boost your game but they have the power to increase your scores EXPONENTIALLY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per run stat tracking will help you analyze your game and make improvements. Lifetime user level stats will not only allow you to track your own progress towards becoming a Cribbish master, but they will unlock special items along the way to give you an even bigger edge.</p>",
    "short_description": "Shuffle chaos. Brew victory. A roguelike deckbuilder where relics, potions, and risky hands rule the table. An arcane twist on Cribbage where potions and relics supercharge your cards and the deck always has an attitude. Choose your build wisely, the cards show no mercy!",
